  "title": "USB Audio: Add missing space in FU Control",
  "description": "Add the space after the channel number to make the second entry of two byte controls look the same as the first one.\n\n```\nClass-specific Audio Control Interface Descriptor: Feature unit descriptor\n    Controls: 03000000\n        Master channel 0 Control: 0x03, Mute, Volume\n        Master channel 0Control: 0x00\n        Logical channel 1 Control: 0x00\n        Logical channel 1Control: 0x00\n```\n\nFixes: ecd60cc7 (\"USB Audio: Fix Feature Unit Descriptor dissection\")",
